<title>CANADA: Canada Nov petroleum product sales rise 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada Nov petroleum product sales rise 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada on Friday issued the following data for sales of refined petroleum products:</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCT SALES (thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996     Nov 1995	 pct</p>
<p>   Total sales		  7,324.7	7,023.7	 +4.3</p>
<p>   Motor gasoline	     2,834.3	2,857.3	 -0.8</p>
<p>   Diesel fuel		  1,750.1	1,638.2	 +6.8</p>
<p>   Light fuel oil		 592.6	  545.3	 +8.7</p>
<p>   Heavy fuel oil		 550.3	  576.2	 -4.5</p>
<p>   Aviation turbo fuels	 425.4	  405.1	 +5.0</p>
<p>   Petrochemical feedstocks   379.1	  332.2	+14.1</p>
<p>   All other products	   792.9	  669.4	+18.4</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact David Roeske, Energy Section, (613) 951-3563.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
</text>
